OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate death of jailed
OL,4,Asurgeon's patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner Judge Richard Foster has
OL,7,Freferred the case of Joan Green to West
OL,8,FMidlands Police. The force said it had
OL,9,Freceived information from the coroner
OL,10,Fin August and had now "advised HM
OL,11,FCoroner we have commenced a criminal
OL,12,Finvestigation to establish more details
OL,13,Faround the circumstances of the death
OL,14,Fof Joan Green".
